-- The Underbog: SkyFire spawned 77 creatures where the sniffs of TrinityCore 3.3.5 (build 14545, 221
-- creatures) and AzerothCore (build 46368, 219) have about 220. Add the rows of the TrinityCore sniff that
-- have nothing of SkyFire within 3 yards, capped to the TrinityCore count per entry, for the creatures that
-- already have SmartAI here (Underbats, Fen Rays, Tribesmen, Oracles, Shamblers, Myrmidons, Giants, Lurkers),
-- the Underbog Frenzies and the critters. The Murkblood Healer, Lykul Wasp, Lykul Stinger and Large AOI
-- Underbat have no SmartAI in SkyFire and are left out.
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 8319260 AND 8319380;

